\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces STAMPEDE on the LGSSM ($T=500, K=2000$). Trace plots (left) show all three samplers exploring the same posterior; histograms (right) confirm that STAMPEDE and Twisted seq match each other to within MC error, while Standard PMCMC's narrower $\phi $ histogram is a symptom of under-mixing rather than higher accuracy.}}{12}{figure.6}}
\newlabel{fig:stampede-lgssm}{{6}{12}{STAMPEDE on the LGSSM ($T=500, K=2000$). Trace plots (left) show all three samplers exploring the same posterior; histograms (right) confirm that STAMPEDE and Twisted seq match each other to within MC error, while Standard PMCMC's narrower $\phi $ histogram is a symptom of under-mixing rather than higher accuracy}{figure.6}{}}
