\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces STAMPEDE on the stochastic volatility model ($T=1000, K=2000$). The grey Standard PMCMC histogram for $\phi $ peaks at $0.98$, far from the true $0.95$; both Twisted seq and STAMPEDE recover the correct posterior, demonstrating that the twisted-DEER smoother is what enables fidelity, while STAMPEDE's outer scan adds a $1.8\times $ wall-clock improvement on top.}}{13}{figure.7}}
\newlabel{fig:stampede-stochvol}{{7}{13}{STAMPEDE on the stochastic volatility model ($T=1000, K=2000$). The grey Standard PMCMC histogram for $\phi $ peaks at $0.98$, far from the true $0.95$; both Twisted seq and STAMPEDE recover the correct posterior, demonstrating that the twisted-DEER smoother is what enables fidelity, while STAMPEDE's outer scan adds a $1.8\times $ wall-clock improvement on top}{figure.7}{}}
